# IBM System/360 Simple Addition Test Program
# Address (Dec) | Byte Value (Hex) | Instruction / Data Description
# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# 0             | 58               | Opcode: L (Load RX, 4 bytes)
# 1             | 10               | R1 = 1, X2 = 0
# 2             | 00               | B2 = 0
# 3             | 20               | D2 = 32 -> Load GPR1 from address 32
# 4             | 58               | Opcode: L (Load RX, 4 bytes)
# 5             | 20               | R1 = 2, X2 = 0
# 6             | 00               | B2 = 0
# 7             | 24               | D2 = 36 -> Load GPR2 from address 36
# 8             | 1A               | Opcode: AR (Add Register RR, 2 bytes)
# 9             | 12               | R1 = 1, R2 = 2 -> GPR1 = GPR1 + GPR2
# 10            | 50               | Opcode: ST (Store RX, 4 bytes)
# 11            | 10               | R1 = 1, X2 = 0
# 12            | 00               | B2 = 0
# 13            | 28               | D2 = 40 -> Store GPR1 to address 40
# 14            | 47               | Opcode: BC (Branch on Condition RX, 4 bytes)
# 15            | F0               | R1 = 15 (Unconditional), X2 = 0
# 16            | 00               | B2 = 0
# 17            | 0E               | D2 = 14 -> Jump to address 14 (infinite loop)

